# The server image and the updater image build from the repository's root and need only the
# crates, the lockfile, the toolchain pin, the migrations, the query cache, and cargo-about's
# configuration for the license notices.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates
!migrations
!.sqlx
!about.toml
!about.hbs
